any of his generation, were prophetic. how is this so?  we do not have to go abroad looking for monsters to destroy because the world&amp;#39;s largest monsters are among us, official and unofficial.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;we are in the grip of evil, all around us, and the evil has been and continues to grow.  the consolation for those of us who care what is done in our name is that, from history, no man made evil lasts in the same form forever.  this includes the domestic evil among us &lt;br /&gt;currently.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6534091438936688029/comments/default/7148625939910240958'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6534091438936688029/comments/default/7148625939910240958'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/02/sheik-omar-death-of-deep-state-asset.html?showComment=1488143459067#c7148625939910240958' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/02/sheik-omar-death-of-deep-state-asset.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6534091438936688029' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6534091438936688029' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-888483120"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2017 at 2:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4499840310390980678</id><published>2017-02-23T20:24:41.355-07:00</published><updated>2017-02-23T20:24:41.355-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Read the Pinkerton Act, for a real solution to the...</title><content type='html'>Read the Pinkerton Act, for a real solution to the crap we deal with today. And it&amp;#39;s not what 99.9 percent think it&amp;#39;s about.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6534091438936688029/comments/default/4499840310390980678'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6534091438936688029/comments/default/4499840310390980678'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/02/sheik-omar-death-of-deep-state-asset.html?showComment=1487906681355#c4499840310390980678' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/02/sheik-omar-death-of-deep-state-asset.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6534091438936688029' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6534091438936688029' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1329402100"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 23, 2017 at 8:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-770000584569666451</id><published>2017-02-23T08:49:32.043-07:00</published><updated>2017-02-23T08:49:32.043-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Great job putting this info together.  I can add o...</title><content type='html'>Great job putting this info together.  I can add one bit to your story that I got by way of a P.D. Scott article. Ali Mohamed was picked up by the RCMP in &amp;#39;93 and then released on the good word of the FBI who explicitly claimed him as an informant.  The original link is here: http://www.historycommons.org/entity.jsp?entity=royal_canadian_mounted_police&lt;br /&gt;It is in archive.org, and I saved a copy here: www.