ruse by which to drive out excellent private enterprise security and replace it with  wretched government controlled  &amp;#39;public law enforcement&amp;#39;. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6534091438936688029/comments/default/6813650040415953398'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6534091438936688029/comments/default/6813650040415953398'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/02/sheik-omar-death-of-deep-state-asset.html?showComment=1487835753342#c6813650040415953398' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/02/sheik-omar-death-of-deep-state-asset.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6534091438936688029' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6534091438936688029' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-137886877"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 23, 2017 at 12:42 AM"/></entry></feed>